      "widgets_values": [
        "For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, the boulevard shown in <Picture 1> keeps its golden-hour backlight, the wet cobblestones, the plane trees along the right side and the pale stone facades receding on the left. The pedestrians in dark coats walking away from camera keep their clothing, spacing and direction: they continue up the street at an unhurried pace while the low sun flares between the trees and the long shadows slide further across the stones. Dust drifts in the light beams, a car crosses the far intersection and slowly disappears, and one figure on the right steps onto the pavement near the end.\n\noverall_soundscape: Soft city ambience with distant traffic and a low crowd murmur. Footsteps and heels click on the wet cobblestones, leaves rustle overhead and a bicycle bell rings once far up the street.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A",
